# Employee Portal — hide HR records for now

In the User Management (Employee Portal) project, **HR records are temporarily hidden**.

- Keep `SHOW_HR_RECORDS = false` in `frontend/src/utils/featureFlags.js` until Dale asks to turn them back on.
- That flag must continue to hide:
  - the **HR records** section on profiles
  - the **Performance** tab on employee detail
  - the **Disciplinary hub** sidebar link
- Do not reintroduce these surfaces in new work unless Dale explicitly asks to enable HR records again.
